1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,227
Mark and a Seal.
马克和海豹。

2
00:00:03,227 --> 00:00:49,953
Mark rented accommodation with his pension near the shore. He paid annual visits there to enjoy the vivid beauty in the depths of the pure sea. Once, with his underwater telescope and flashlight, Mark dived along the boundary between the steep reef and the area of seaweed conservation.
马克用养老金在海边租了住处。他每年都到那里，欣赏那鲜活的美景，在清澈大海的深处。有一次，带着水下望远镜和手电筒，马克沿着一条交界线潜水，那是陡峭礁石与海草保护区之间的边界。

3
00:00:49,953 --> 00:01:21,547
Suddenly, an awesome Antarctic seal with sharp teeth appeared opposite him. Every cell in his body was scared to death. But soon, he was aware that he wasn’t the target of an attack.
突然，一只长着尖牙、令人生畏的南极海豹出现在他对面。他全身每一个细胞都吓坏了。但很快，他意识到自己并不是被攻击的目标。

4
00:01:21,547 --> 00:01:56,873
With a neat wound in its lip caused by a shark, this grey seal was washed upside down by the tides time after time. But it tried to jog Mark as if to urge him to help it. So Mark abandoned fleeing away.
这只海豹嘴唇上有一道鲨鱼造成的整齐伤口，灰色的身体被潮水一次又一次地掀翻。但它试着轻碰马克，仿佛在催促他帮帮自己。于是马克放弃了逃跑。

5
00:01:56,873 --> 00:02:40,400
With its cooperation, Mark used a net to drag the seal to the shallow water. Without pausing he helped it out after a simple operation and settled it in a narrow cave by the seaside. Every time he brought it tasty fish, it would yell and suck his hands happily.
在海豹的配合下，马克用网把它拖到了浅水处。他没有停歇，做了一个简单手术，帮助它脱险，然后把它安置在海边一个狭窄的洞穴里。每次他带来美味的鱼，它都会高兴地叫着，吮吸他的手。

6
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:55,793
Witnesses said their anecdotes reflected a magic dimension of the relationship between humans and animals.
目击者说，他们的故事展示了奇妙的一面，那就是人类与动物之间的关系。
